"Odoo stores your model as a record of <code>ir.model</code>, and each field "
"as a record of <code>ir.model.fields</code>. A model created in the database"
" must start with <code>x_</code>: yours is <code>x_{{p}}_{{item}}</code>, "
"and its fields <code>x_name</code>, <code>x_{{maker}}</code>... In a module,"
" it is <code>{{p}}.{{item}}</code>."
msgstr ""
"Odoo menyimpan model-mu sebagai record <code>ir.model</code>, dan setiap "
"field sebagai record <code>ir.model.fields</code>. Model yang dibuat di "
"database harus diawali <code>x_</code>: milikmu adalah "
"<code>x_{{p}}_{{item}}</code>, dan field-nya <code>x_name</code>, "
"<code>x_{{maker}}</code>... Di dalam modul, namanya "
"<code>{{p}}.{{item}}</code>."

